			<div class="relative pl-[34px] tab:pl-0 tab:pt-[30px]" data-rv><span class="absolute left-0 top-[3px] size-[14px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-amber bg-bg tab:left-[10px] tab:top-0"></span><span class="font-mono text-[12.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-amber">$ git init</span><h4 class="mb-[10px] mt-[9px] text-[16.5px] font-bold">你带着想法来</h4><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.95] text-sub">不用需求文档。一次语音、几张截图，或者一句「我想做个 XXX」，就能开工。</p><span class="mt-3 block font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-[1.7] text-green before:text-faint before:content-['→_产出_']">一页纸的范围共识，当天定稿</span></div>
			<div class="relative pl-[34px] tab:pl-0 tab:pt-[30px]" data-rv style="transition-delay:.1s"><span class="absolute left-0 top-[3px] size-[14px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-amber bg-bg tab:left-[10px] tab:top-0"></span><span class="font-mono text-[12.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-amber">$ git checkout -b mvp</span><h4 class="mb-[10px] mt-[9px] text-[16.5px] font-bold">两周出第一版</h4><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.95] text-sub">只做核心流程的最小闭环：能跑、能给真人用。其余的，一律先不写。</p><span class="mt-3 block font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-[1.7] text-green before:text-faint before:content-['→_产出_']">一个能点的链接 + 测试账号</span></div>
			<div class="relative pl-[34px] tab:pl-0 tab:pt-[30px]" data-rv style="transition-delay:.2s"><span class="absolute left-0 top-[3px] size-[14px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-amber bg-bg tab:left-[10px] tab:top-0"></span><span class="font-mono text-[12.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-amber">$ git commit</span><h4 class="mb-[10px] mt-[9px] text-[16.5px] font-bold">交给真实用户</h4><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.95] text-sub">第一版直接面对用户。反馈回来的每一条，都会变成下一次提交。</p><span class="mt-3 block font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-[1.7] text-green before:text-faint before:content-['→_产出_']">每周一次的可见迭代</span></div>
			<div class="relative pl-[34px] tab:pl-0 tab:pt-[30px]" data-rv style="transition-delay:.3s"><span class="absolute left-0 top-[3px] size-[14px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-amber bg-bg tab:left-[10px] tab:top-0"></span><span class="font-mono text-[12.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-amber">$ merge 主线</span><h4 class="mb-[10px] mt-[9px] text-[16.5px] font-bold">验证后加大投入</h4><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.95] text-sub">跑通了就补体验、补安全、补那些「早晚要还」的技术债，把它变成正经产品。</p><span class="mt-3 block font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-[1.7] text-green before:text-faint before:content-['→_产出_']">稳定版 + 补齐的底子</span></div>
			<div class="relative pl-[34px] tab:pl-0 tab:pt-[30px]" data-rv style="transition-delay:.4s"><span class="absolute left-0 top-[3px] size-[14px] rounded-full border-[3px] border-amber bg-bg tab:left-[10px] tab:top-0"></span><span class="font-mono text-[12.5px] tracking-[.03em] text-amber">$ git push</span><h4 class="mb-[10px] mt-[9px] text-[16.5px] font-bold">一起持续迭代</h4><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.95] text-sub">上线不是结束。产品每长大一点，我们的合作就多一个 commit。</p><span class="mt-3 block font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-[1.7] text-green before:text-faint before:content-['→_产出_']">一个一直有人管的产品</span></div>
